{"id": 46, "name": "Odette", "splash": "https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/mobile-legends/images/e/ed/Hero461-portrait.png/revision/latest?cb=20250117141936", "cls": ["Mage", ""], "specialty": ["Burst", "Poke"], "difficulty": "20", "stats": ["30", "100", "70", "20"], "lanes": ["Mid Lane", ""], "story": "Innocent princess that grew up in the Swan Castle and genius mage that excels in sword and scepter.", "skills": [{"name": "Lakeshore Ambience", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ea1dc3bb32cd7ca47e7a8aa0c0864278.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "For 8s after casting a skill, Odette's next Basic Attack gains extra range and bounces between enemies (or an enemy and herself), dealing 144-200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> per hit.\n\nOdette's skills also trigger this effect on hit (up to 3 stacks)."}, {"name": "Avian Authority", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_e97b9ebeb8147c1ddd5610e36b4541cd.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 32, "tagname": "AOE", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 22, "tagname": "Slow", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 6   Mana Cost: 65", "desc": "Odette releases a magic swan in the target direction, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies hit and slowing them by 30% for 2s."}, {"name": "Blue Nova", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_630483c59b2a2eb1c6b9f3bdfc369dc8.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}, {"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}], "cdcost": "CD: 12   Mana Cost: 75", "desc": "Odette releases magic energy balls in the target direction, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to the first enemy hit and immobilizing them for 1.5s. Upon hit, an energy ball splits off to attack a nearby enemy (prioritizes enemy heroes), dealing 250<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+50% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> and immobilizing them for 1.5s."}, {"name": "Swan Song", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_2f47fdb064b3c880cfc853d921ef090b.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 50   Mana Cost: 160", "desc": "Odette begins to dance, gaining a 1200<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+150% Total Magic Power)</span> shield while dealing up to 2000<span style=\"color:#62f8fe\"> (+750% Total Magic Power)</span> <span style=\"color:#7f62fe\">Magic Damage</span> to enemies in a large area around her for 5s. The bounce speed and frequency of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Lakeshore Ambience</span>'s sound wave in the area are also enhanced when the skill is active.\nUse again while the skill is active to dash in the target direction.\n<span style=\"color:#A4AAC7\">The skill is a channeling cast and will be interrupted if Odette is hit by high level control effects (knocked airborne, transformed, etc.) or if she performs another action.</span>"}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Arcane Boots", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_1a0d5709c23c25849cca889cb1303ecb.png"}, {"name": "Glowing Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_df12c0f80844640a7b40cf64798be915.png"}, {"name": "Genius Wand", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_5f615aa7cb949d4e43d24561b12ff0e1.png"}, {"name": "Divine Glaive", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_ef0ab8d629f06ebd67cf2b65e144f803.png"}, {"name": "Winter Crown", "icon": "https://ak